    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A dark mansion, a dull room, and the maze-like corridors\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every midnight, \u201csomething\u201d in the mansion strikes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But\u2013</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">None of it matters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Erica, a girl who has been sold, is about to start her new life with the notorious Duke in this horrible mansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Facing the completely incomprehensible Duke, she has to tiptoe through the daily fearful routine of being beheaded if she utters a wrong word!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The scared-to-death girl x The stony-faced woman dressed as a man, a corny and sweet Beauty and the Beast Yuri story is coming soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Character:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716480/extras/655dc451044132e9654d22b68b06296f.avif?t=1750954232\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Erica\uff1a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The protagonist, who is sold by her parents to the Duke. She thinks fortune favors her, and her goal is to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716480/extras/485bcc22470047e40c486c2156a82e0c.avif?t=1750954232\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Louise\uff1a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rumor has it that the Duke is a creature of terror. But in fact, she\u2019s a beauty disguised as a man, her expressionless face is because she rarely comes into contact with people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716480/extras/30514b2cc4863453316b57f18028ad4f.avif?t=1750954232\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Maiden:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A suspicious maid who holds an unspecified grudge against Erica.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">GamePlay:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players will view the story from Erika\u2019s perspective, and progress through one choice after another to reach the ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is only one route with three endings. After clearing one round, you can enjoy the story from other characters\u2019 point of view.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PS. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*This game depicts minor (really, really little) violence and gore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*This game contains a little bit of explicit depiction and eroticism, but there are <strong>no</strong> pornographic or indescribable scenes! No worries!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716480/extras/f76765ad455f3499af1f41eacfc7e49f.avif?t=1750954232\" /></div><br>About us\uff1a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cTied by your Red\u201d is Yurif's second completed project, and we are experimenting with different expression styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We hope you all enjoy this tiny pink cheesy romance drama wrapped in a horror game skin.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A dark mansion, a dull room, and the maze-like corridors\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every midnight, \u201csomething\u201d in the mansion strikes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But\u2013</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">None of it matters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Erica, a girl who has been sold, is about to start her new life with the notorious Duke in this horrible mansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Facing the completely incomprehensible Duke, she has to tiptoe through the daily fearful routine of being beheaded if she utters a wrong word!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The scared-to-death girl x The stony-faced woman dressed as a man, a corny and sweet Beauty and the Beast Yuri story is coming soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Character:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716480/extras/655dc451044132e9654d22b68b06296f.avif?t=1750954232\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Erica\uff1a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The protagonist, who is sold by her parents to the Duke. She thinks fortune favors her, and her goal is to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716480/extras/485bcc22470047e40c486c2156a82e0c.avif?t=1750954232\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Louise\uff1a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rumor has it that the Duke is a creature of terror. But in fact, she\u2019s a beauty disguised as a man, her expressionless face is because she rarely comes into contact with people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716480/extras/30514b2cc4863453316b57f18028ad4f.avif?t=1750954232\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Maiden:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A suspicious maid who holds an unspecified grudge against Erica.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">GamePlay:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players will view the story from Erika\u2019s perspective, and progress through one choice after another to reach the ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is only one route with three endings. After clearing one round, you can enjoy the story from other characters\u2019 point of view.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PS. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*This game depicts minor (really, really little) violence and gore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*This game contains a little bit of explicit depiction and eroticism, but there are <strong>no</strong> pornographic or indescribable scenes! No worries!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716480/extras/f76765ad455f3499af1f41eacfc7e49f.avif?t=1750954232\" /></div><br>About us\uff1a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cTied by your Red\u201d is Yurif's second completed project, and we are experimenting with different expression styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We hope you all enjoy this tiny pink cheesy romance drama wrapped in a horror game skin.</p>",
